//TITLE:	GTA:SA ".pnach" Cheats & In-Game Cheats
//Author: 	TKBS
//DATE: 	2025
//GAME: 	GTA:SA PAL 2004 (BLACK) - Hybrid (60hz Y POS patch)
//INFO:		Cheats & Codes for PAL. New + organising existing ones + original values data for finding in other versions, regions.
//Credits:	TKBS = ".pnach" & ".ct" cheats, Documentation, scans, Modkit.
//Credits:	AR Max CD
//[Notes: Important]
//** Addresses Change (Dynamic).
//** Optional: Use the Clean Starter "Save State" provided that these cheats were made with, so the game keeps the same addresses & all the cheats work.

//TODO:
//Parachute, Jetpack, 100% Complete, Bonus Unlocks.

//Notes:
//* Parachute & jetpack can be spawned using code - edit the "main.scm" file with "sannybuilder.exe"

// ---- PATCH PAL 60hz ----
//* Use hex edit on the elf file: "SLES_525.41" 		- Patches PAL -> hz (60hz, fps). * This will also change the "CRC: A1B3F232" to "CRC: 85A76633"
//	[00447D40]	03 94 06 00	-> 	02 00 12 24

//--------------------------------------------------------------------
//-------------- TESTS Junk, Fails, Unknown, Not tested --------------
//--------------------------------------------------------------------

